{"unit_id":"hqa-shu__dsh-review-mode#feature-1","repo":"hqa-shu/dsh-review-mode","commit":"36e0742e13a98c30a34483a1db08b021043f2133","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Review Mode 的功能「选择复审对象」：在右侧面板选择当前 DSH、其他本机 DSH 会话或 Codex 对话，并可指定审用户、审整段交流或审 AI 回答。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:2311-2353","reviewer.js:39-56","reviewer.js:1125-1178"]}
